        <briefdescription>
<para>Handles the --extract command line option. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads the font named by --extract and the manifest named by --manifest. Every outline and advance is scaled from the font&apos;s units per em to the sheet&apos;s units per em, and drawn into a raw sheet: one cell per character above the space, plus one cell per ligature that shaping finds. A manifest without a glyphs table gains one built from the raw sheet, and is written back. The sheet is then laid out from the manifest&apos;s glyphs table, so only the cells that the table lists are written, to the path that the weight table named by --weight gives. The manifest metrics are read and never changed.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>args</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The parsed command line arguments; must carry --extract, --manifest and --weight. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
